<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower. Demand light very light with most buyers out of the market or bidding for late week delivery. Top $53.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 52.00-53.00, few 51.50.</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.  40.00-44.00</p>
<p>	  450-500 lbs.  44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs.  48.00-50.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs.  49.00-51.00, few 52.00</p>
</text>
